cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "reg-to-eval: one regulatory obligation, made testable"
abstract: >-
  Translates one EU AI Act transparency obligation (Article 50(1),
  AI-disclosure) into a runnable Inspect eval: a task, sixteen clause-tagged
  samples including scorer-adversarial cases, and a model-graded judge, with
  every legal interpretation tiered by who verified it in LEGAL_SIGNOFF.md.
  Explicitly a scaffold, not a finished evaluation: no real model has been
  evaluated and no number in the repository is a result.
type: software
version: "0.0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alejandro-publius/reg-to-eval"
